  "text": "Janet Lori | Animal Emergency & Specialty Center - Parker (AESC)\nSkip to Primary Content\nBook a Consultation\nMap\n17701 Cottonwood Dr,\nParker,\nCO,\n80134\nCall\n(720) 842-5050\n24/7 Emergency\n24/7 Emergency\nPhone:\n(720) 842-5050\nAddress:\n17701 Cottonwood Dr,\nParker,\nCO,\n80134\nContact Us\nLewis and Clark Fund\nBlog\nAbout Us\nWelcome to AESC\nOur Team\nWhat Is A Board-Certified Specialist?\nOur History\nOur Philosophy\nServices\nEmergency\nAnesthesiology & Pain Management\nCardiology\nCritical Care\nDiagnostic Imaging\nInternal Medicine\nNeurology\nOncology\nRehabilitation\nSurgery\nTPLO (CCL Tear Repair)\nView all Services\nPet Owners\nAppointments\nResources\nAccommodations\nFinancial\nFAQs\nVeterinarians\nVeterinarians\nReferrals\nResources\nVeterinarian FAQ\nContinuing Education\nCareers\n24/7 Emergency\nBook a Consultation\nJanet Lori\nJanet Lori\nDVM, MS, DACVIM (Oncology)\nA native of Dallas, Texas, Dr. Lori earned her undergraduate degree in veterinary science at Texas A&M University. She then graduated from A&M’s College of Veterinary Medicine in 2005. She moved from Texas to Colorado State University, where she completed a one-year small animal medicine and surgery rotating internship, as well as a residency program in small animal oncology. Dr. Lori became board-certified in internal medicine (Oncology) through the American College of Veterinary Internal Medicine in 2010, and also completed her Masters of Clinical Science.\nDr. Lori joined the crew at AESC as our staff oncologist in August, 2011. Dr. Lori enjoys all things oncology, with a particular interest in the new and exciting options available for the treatment of mast cell tumors.\nAnimal Emergency & Specialty Center\n17701 Cottonwood Dr\nParker\n,\nCO\n80134\nT:\n(720) 842-5050\nF:\n(720) 842-5060\nHours of Operation\nMain Hours\nMon\nOpen 24 hrs\nTue\nOpen 24 hrs\nWed\nOpen 24 hrs\nThu\nOpen 24 hrs\nFri\nOpen 24 hrs\nSat\nOpen 24 hrs\nSun\nOpen 24 hrs\nContact Us\nAbout Us\nServices\nFinancial\nResources\nCareers\nAccessibility\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms & Conditions\nBlog\nCookie Preferences\nDo Not Sell or Share My Information\n©\nCopyright\n2026",
